== Anchor reconciliation (why 9.2 / 34-38 / 486 differ from the measured mint) ==
measured mint (the compile at true keys): 4.46 us coast, 4.44 us burn
9.2 us  = add_body: compile + catalogue insert + bind_exact + store write (c4d3; the sticky wired path)
34-38   = b29a's composed EVENT: compile 9.5 + readout 5.4 + from_state refit 21 + scar 0.9;
         the refit is the kick's own settle bill (inside e7ef's kick C-hat), not the promotion's
486 us  = resolve_handout, the wired sticky leaver (367f/b29a): dead by 13x

